79	// barrel — that barrel has a top-level side effect (`AmexSymbol.viewBox = ...`) that throws
80	// under Vitest (SVG imports resolve to raw path strings here, not components). Same root cause,
81	// same fix shape, as testing.md's documented ZimmIcon workaround, just via a different import
82	// path (PromoPopover, not ZimmIcon) — not fixable from this test file beyond mocking it away.
83	vi.mock('@salesforce/retail-react-app/app/components/promo-popover', () => ({
